# Always deploy to webcomet.ru

When you finish code changes for WebComet:

1. Commit (unless the user forbade commits for that change).
2. Push to `origin/main`.
3. Deploy immediately via SSH (scale stack):
   `ssh -o BatchMode=yes root@92.242.61.24 "cd /opt/webcomet && git fetch origin main && git reset --hard origin/main && docker compose -f docker-compose.scale.yml up -d --build && docker compose -f docker-compose.scale.yml ps"`
4. Do not wait for the user to ask «задеплой».

Prod: https://webcomet.ru · VPS `/opt/webcomet` · compose: `docker-compose.scale.yml`.
